# RISE NETWORK — environment variables
# Copy to .env.local for local development. NEVER commit real values.
# Only variables prefixed with VITE_ are exposed to the browser. Never put a
# service-role key, database password or any other secret in a VITE_ variable.
#
# Leave both empty to run the public site without accounts (accounts then show
# as unavailable). For local development, get the values from:
#   npx supabase status
# (API_URL and ANON_KEY / PUBLISHABLE_KEY).

# Supabase project URL. Local CLI stack for this project: http://127.0.0.1:55321
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
# Supabase anon (public) key. Public by design; access is enforced by Row Level Security.
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
